       <td colspan="2" width="475"> <span style="width:475px;font-size:10pt;"> <a href="http://kind.krx.co.kr/common/disclsviewer.do?method=search&amp;acptno=20230801000520&amp;rcpno=20230801000520&amp;orgid=G&amp;tran=Y&amp;langTpCd=0" target="_blank" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:xh="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">2023-08-01 투자판단 관련 주요경영사항</a> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> <a href="http://kind.krx.co.kr/common/disclsviewer.do?method=search&amp;acptno=20231023000532&amp;rcpno=20231023000532&amp;orgid=G&amp;tran=Y&amp;langTpCd=0" target="_blank" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:xh="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">2023-10-23 투자판단 관련 주요경영사항</a> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> </span> </td> 
